  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Encrypted/BH_E_Title.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"704\"></p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>Encrypted_ — это фантастический модпак с квестами для Minecraft 1.18.2. Он включает технологические моды, такие как [Mekanism/Create/Thermal], и магические моды, такие как [Blood Magic/Hexerei/Mahou Tsukai/Mana and Artifice]. В нём также есть ХИМИЯ!</strong></span></h4><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>Продвигайтесь по разным модам и стройте сложные машины и фабрики, ставя перед собой цели создавать креативные предметы и добиться величия! Начинаете вы в пустой симуляции, где ваша цель — вернуться в реальность!</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>Этот пакет не совместим с Optifine</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Encrypted/BH_E_Community.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/834pwJ9\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://piperlibraryfiles.com/ckfinder/connector?command=Proxy&amp;lang=en&amp;type=Cottonwood&amp;currentFolder=/Youth Services/Young Adults/&amp;hash=6eb91e00882ecd77c007c5fb2a58441e0d773fb6&amp;fileName=join the discord.png\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crypt1k\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LvLgJKC.png\" width=\"370\" height=\"69\"></a><span><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fencrypted_%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1ji64K.png\" alt=\"оцените нас\" width=\"838\" height=\"140\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fcryptic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Ki4NpFa.png\" width=\"756\" height=\"330\"></a></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>Видео на YouTube:</strong></span></h2><div class=\"spoiler\"><h2><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X_AVPURaB_A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h2><h2><span><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xpe8bBp9tsc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></h2><h2><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h2><h2><span><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NTnUVyDLw8c?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></h2><h2><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h2><h2><span><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UvXWhETkjg0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></h2><p><span><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/l5dRJFDaz8Q?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pOgJGd3v_nU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p></div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-